  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Supporting the Efforts of the Government of Ukraine to Address the Impact of COVID-19 Pandemic on Internal Labor Trafficking</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will meet the urgent need to provide protection assistance to victims of trafficking who suffered from internal trafficking for forced labor in Ukraine, returning migrant workers and other vulnerable populations in the context of the COVID-19 pandemic. The goal of the project will be met through two objectives: (1) Enhancing capacities of local social services and NGOs to provide assistance services remotely in view of COVID-19 pandemic and (2) Facilitating access to continuous individual-based protection assistance for victims of internal labor trafficking following a sharp decrease of central government protection response due to COVID-19 pandemic.</narrative>
  </description>
